00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:21,620
Order flow terms.

25
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:24,229
Now, there are a lot of terms specific to order

26
00:01:24,229 --> 00:01:25,794
flow trading that you don't see

27
00:01:25,794 --> 00:01:27,359
in other forms of technical analysis.

28
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:31,060
I've decided to list them here so that you can read them and see them.

29
