00:18:02,970 --> 00:18:09,390
You know, technically that is an imbalance, but it's imbalances that's not necessarily occurring on very much volume.

255
00:18:10,190 --> 00:18:16,750
I like to see it when it matters. And when it matters is when there's decent volume that's traded.

256
00:18:16,750 --> 00:18:22,130
Okay, a large print on a bottom.

