00:19:25,483 --> 00:19:29,749
feel, when it's at the lows of the day or at a low of a move.

276
00:19:30,710 --> 00:19:33,270
You know, it's basically someone coming in and supporting the market.

277
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:39,060
Okay. A large print on the top.

278
00:19:39,060 --> 00:19:41,900
Now, it's referred to as stopping volume.

279
00:19:42,120 --> 00:19:43,582
It's, you know, it's basically the

280
00:19:43,582 --> 00:19:45,044
mirror image of large print on

281
00:19:45,044 --> 00:19:47,238
the bottom, only this time it's at the top.

282
00:19:48,300 --> 00:19:50,366
It'll occur at the top of a red candlestick where

