00:23:27,799 --> 00:23:30,828
the way up to having a positive delta

329
00:23:30,828 --> 00:23:32,721
of 1778. And, it ended at 1733.

330
00:23:39,010 --> 00:23:42,590
Negative delta indicates that more volume was sold into the bid.

331
00:23:42,910 --> 00:23:45,130
In other words, aggressive sellers were stronger than buyers.

332
00:23:45,130 --> 00:23:50,570
So, you know, the delta, you're going to look at the delta number on a bar.

333
00:23:50,950 --> 00:23:57,530
And, if it's positive, then it's positive delta. If it's negative, then it's considered negative delta.

334
00:23:58,010 --> 00:23:59,010
Why is it important?

