340
00:24:11,534 --> 00:24:14,750
going anywhere, either the market has a propensity to later sell off.

341
00:24:15,130 --> 00:24:21,390
Or, you know, go sideways for a while until selling sort of subsided.

342
00:24:22,090 --> 00:24:26,110
But, I mean, we'll get into the analysis of delta, you know, later.

343
00:24:26,770 --> 00:24:32,170
But, let's, you know, just understand when a bar has a delta number that's negative, that's negative delta.

344
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:33,850
If it's positive, that's positive delta.

345
00:24:35,430 --> 00:24:40,590
So, okay, a normal ratio number, a.k.a. average ratio number.

