00:25:59,540 --> 00:26:02,611
It's when two side-by-side bars are opposite in direction, a

365
00:26:02,611 --> 00:26:07,078
green candle followed by a red candle, or a red candle followed by a green candle.

366
00:26:06,860 --> 00:26:09,800
Usually, you've got the point of controls at the same levels.

367
00:26:09,800 --> 00:26:12,278
Like here, you've got, you know, you've

368
00:26:12,278 --> 00:26:14,756
got a red bar, you've got a

369
00:26:14,756 --> 00:26:20,420
green bar following it, and you've got the point of controls right at the same level.

370
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:24,820
Let me tell you that you've got a green, red, green, red, green.

371
00:26:25,940 --> 00:26:29,590
Once you start stringing together bars like that, especially when the point

372
00:26:29,590 --> 00:26:32,023
of controls are kind of, you know, at

373
00:26:32,023 --> 00:26:35,978
the same level, oftentimes, it's an indication of a market that's going nowhere.

374
00:26:36,220 --> 00:26:37,000
It's trading sideways.

